{
  "pluginAlias": "HomebridgeADB",
  "pluginType": "platform",
  "singular": true,
  "headerDisplay": "A simple homebridge script to control remote ADB enabled Android device",
  "footerDisplay": "For more information, see the [README](https://github.com/dwaan/homebridge-adb/blob/master/README.md) or [FAQ](https://github.com/dwaan/homebridge-adb/blob/master/FAQ.md).",
  "schema": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "name": {
        "title": "Plugin Name",
        "type": "string",
        "default": "Homebridge ADB",
        "required": true
      },
      "accessories": {
        "title": "Android Devices",
        "type": "array",
        "required": true,
        "items": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "name": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "Device Name",
              "placeholder": "Eg: Your Device Name",
              "minLength": 1,
              "required": true
            },
            "ip": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "IP Address",
              "placeholder": "Eg: 192.168.1.1",
              "format": "ipv4",
              "required": true
            },
            "path": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "ADB Path",
              "placeholder": "Eg: /usr/bin/adb or c:\\adb-tools\\adb.exe"
            },
            "mac": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "MAC address",
              "placeholder": "Eg: 4d:23:ca:5e:78:3e",
              "format": "mac",
              "required": false
            },
            "timeout": {
              "type": "number",
              "title": "ADB Timeout",
              "minimum": 1000,
              "maximum": 5000
            },
            "interval": {
              "type": "number",
              "title": "Polling interval",
              "minimum": 500,
              "maximum": 10000
            },
            "category": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "Category",
              "oneOf": [
                {
                  "title": "Apple TV",
                  "enum": ["APPLE_TV"]
                },
                {
                  "title": "Television",
                  "enum": ["TELEVISION"]
                },
                {
                  "title": "Streaming Stick",
                  "enum": ["TV_STREAMING_STICK"]
                },
                {
                  "title": "Set Top Box",
                  "enum": ["TV_SET_TOP_BOX"]
                },
                {
                  "title": "Audio Reciever",
                  "enum": ["AUDIO_RECEIVER"]
                },
                {
                  "title": "Speaker",
                  "enum": ["SPEAKER"]
                }
              ]
            },
            "inputs": {
              "title": "Inputs",
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "name": {
                    "title": "Name",
                    "type": "string",
                    "placeholder": "eg: App name",
                    "required": true
                  },
                  "id": {
                    "title": "App ID",
                    "type": "string",
                    "placeholder": "eg: com.your.app.id",
                    "required": true
                  },
                  "adb": {
                    "title": "or, Command",
                    "type": "string",
                    "placeholder": "eg: monkey -p home 1",
                    "required": false
                  },
                  "switch": {
                    "title": "Also create Switch accessory for this input",
                    "type": "boolean",
                    "required": false
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "hidenumber": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "title": "Hide 'Inputs' number in Home App"
            },
            "hidehome": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "title": "Hide 'Home' Input in Home App"
            },
            "hideother": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "title": "Hide 'Other' Input in Home App"
            },
            "playbacksensor": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "title": "Playback as Motion Sensor"
            },
            "playbacksensorexclude": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "Exclude this app from Playback Sensor",
              "placeholder": "eg: com.your.app.id",
              "description": "You can provide one or more app ids to exclude it from playback sensor, use space between the app ids to seperate them."
            },
            "playbacksensordelay": {
              "type": "number",
              "title": "Sensor off delay (ms)",
              "minimum": 500,
              "maximum": 50000
            },
            "debug": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "title": "Display more debug message"
            },
            "skipSpeaker": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "title": "Skip speaker/volume creation"
            },
            "upbutton": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "Up",
              "placeholder": "eg: KEYCODE_DPAD_UP",
              "minLength": 9
            },
            "downbutton": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "Down",
              "placeholder": "eg: KEYCODE_DPAD_DOWN",
              "minLength": 9
            },
            "leftbutton": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "Left",
              "placeholder": "eg: KEYCODE_DPAD_LEFT",
              "minLength": 9
            },
            "rightbutton": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "Right",
              "placeholder": "eg: KEYCODE_DPAD_RIGHT",
              "minLength": 9
            },
            "selectbutton": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "Select",
              "placeholder": "eg: KEYCODE_ENTER",
              "minLength": 9
            },
            "backbutton": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "Back",
              "placeholder": "eg: KEYCODE_BACK",
              "minLength": 9
            },
            "playpausebutton": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "Play/Pause",
              "placeholder": "eg: KEYCODE_MEDIA_PLAY_PAUSE",
              "minLength": 9
            },
            "infobutton": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "Info",
              "placeholder": "eg: KEYCODE_HOME",
              "minLength": 9
            },
            "poweron": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "Power On",
              "placeholder": "eg: KEYCODE_POWER"
            },
            "poweronretry": {
              "type": "number",
              "title": "Power On Retry",
              "minimum": 1,
              "maximum": 10
            },
            "poweroff": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "Power Off",
              "placeholder": "eg: KEYCODE_POWER"
            },
            "volumeup": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "Volume Up",
              "placeholder": "eg: KEYCODE_VOLUME_UP"
            },
            "volumedown": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "Volume Down",
              "placeholder": "eg: KEYCODE_VOLUME_DOWN"
            },
            "stateAdbCommand": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "State Command",
              "placeholder": "eg: dumpsys power | grep mHoldingDisplaySuspendBlocker="
            },
            "stateAdbOutputAwake": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "State Command Output",
              "placeholder": "eg: true (case sensitive)"
            },
            "launcherid": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "Default Launcher App Id",
              "placeholder": "eg: com.spocky.projengmenu"
            },
            "shelltimeout": {
              "type": "number",
              "title": "Shell Command Timeout",
              "description": "Timeout in milliseconds for local shell scripts used by power, startup, keepalive, and input commands.",
              "minimum": 1000,
              "maximum": 120000,
              "default": 30000
            },
            "connectonstartup": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "title": "Connect On Startup",
              "description": "Run the configured startup command during plugin startup before attempting the initial ADB connection. This should not force the TV display on.",
              "default": false
            },
            "startupcommand": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "Startup Command",
              "description": "Command used for startup ADB preparation. Use a connect-only script here, not the normal power-on script.",
              "placeholder": "shell /bin/bash /var/lib/homebridge/adb/connect-tcl-tv.sh"
            },
            "keepadbalivewhensleeping": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "title": "Keep ADB Alive While Sleeping",
              "description": "Periodically runs the keepalive command while the TV is sleeping so ADB remains reachable without turning the TV on.",
              "default": false
            },
            "keepalivecommand": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "Keepalive Command",
              "description": "Command used to keep sleeping ADB reachable. Use a connect-only script that does not send wake/home keycodes.",
              "placeholder": "shell /bin/bash /var/lib/homebridge/adb/connect-tcl-tv.sh"
            },
            "keepaliveinterval": {
              "type": "number",
              "title": "Keepalive Interval",
              "description": "How often to run the sleeping keepalive command.",
              "minimum": 10000,
              "maximum": 300000,
              "default": 30000
            },
            "connectiondebouncecount": {
              "type": "number",
              "title": "Connection Debounce Count",
              "description": "Number of repeated connected/disconnected events required before logging a connection state change.",
              "minimum": 1,
              "maximum": 10,
              "default": 2
            },
            "suppresssleepingdisconnectlogs": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "title": "Suppress Sleeping Disconnect Logs",
              "description": "Suppress repeated ADB disconnect logs while the TV is logically sleeping.",
              "default": true
            },
            "startupsettledelay": {
            "type": "number",
            "title": "Startup Settle Delay",
            "description": "Delay in milliseconds after startup connect before model/state detection.",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 10000,
            "default": 500
          },
          "powersettledelay": {
            "type": "number",
            "title": "Power Settle Delay",
            "description": "Delay in milliseconds after power on/off during which sleeping keepalive is paused.",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 60000,
            "default": 20000
          },
          "fastpoweroff": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "title": "Fast Power Off",
            "description": "For one-way sleep commands like KEYCODE_SLEEP, send the command once instead of waiting through the wrapper power-off loop.",
            "default": false
          }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "layout": [
    {
      "key": "accessories",
      "type": "array",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "flex",
          "items": [
            {
              "type": "flex",
              "displayFlex": true,
              "flex-direction": "row",
              "items": [
                {
                  "key": "accessories[].name"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "flex",
              "displayFlex": true,
              "flex-direction": "row",
              "items": [
                {
                  "key": "accessories[].ip",
                  "flex": "2 2 200px"
                },
                {
                  "key": "accessories[].category",
                  "flex": "1 1 100px"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "flex",
              "displayFlex": true,
              "flex-direction": "row",
              "items": [
                {
                  "key": "accessories[].path"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "flex",
              "displayFlex": true,
              "flex-direction": "row",
              "items": [
                {
                  "key": "accessories[].timeout",
                  "flex": "1 1 100px"
                },
                {
                  "key": "accessories[].interval",
                  "flex": "1 1 100px"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "flex",
              "displayFlex": true,
              "flex-direction": "row",
              "items": [
                {
                  "key": "accessories[].shelltimeout",
                  "flex": "1 1 100px"
                },
                {
                  "key": "accessories[].connectonstartup",
                  "flex": "1 1 100px"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "title": "Inputs",
              "expandable": true,
              "expanded": false,
              "description": "Add Android app or scripts as inputs in Home app. Optionally display it as a Switch accessory for Siri command or HomeKit automation.",
              "items": [
                {
                  "description": "<p>This plugins will support up to 50 inputs, after adding more then 50 inputs, this accessory will need to be remove and readd in Home App for the inputs to be displayed properly.</p><p>Check Homebridge logs for current <b>App ID</b>. For <b>Command</b>:</p><ul><li>You can put ADB shell command, eg: \"<code>monkey -p com.termux 1</code>\".</li><li>Or, you can also put a shell script, add \"<code>shell</code>\" identifier on the beginning to let the plugins know it's a shell script, eg: \"<code>shell sh ./myscript.sh</code>\".</li></ul><p><b>Note:</b> As a Switch accessory, turning it off will make the device navigate to home screen.</p>",
                  "items": []
                },
                {
                  "key": "accessories[].inputs",
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "type": "flex",
                      "displayFlex": false,
                      "flex-direction": "column",
                      "items": [
                        {
                          "type": "flex",
                          "displayFlex": false,
                          "flex-direction": "row",
                          "items": [
                            {
                              "key": "accessories[].inputs[].name",
                              "flex": "3 3 70px"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "accessories[].inputs[].id",
                              "flex": "5 5 170px"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "accessories[].inputs[].adb",
                              "flex": "5 5 170px"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "key": "accessories[].inputs[].switch",
                          "flex": "1 1 1"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "title": "Wake On LAN",
              "expandable": true,
              "expanded": false,
              "description": "Plugin will try to use Wake On LAN when you provide your device MAC address, if your device supported it. Useful when your device disconnected from Network after it turned off.",
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "flex",
                  "displayFlex": true,
                  "flex-direction": "row",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "key": "accessories[].mac",
                      "flex": "1 1 100px"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "title": "Startup and Sleeping ADB",
              "expandable": true,
              "expanded": false,
              "description": "Advanced startup and sleeping transport options. Use connect-only scripts here, not scripts that send wake/home keycodes.",
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "flex",
                  "displayFlex": true,
                  "flex-direction": "column",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "key": "accessories[].startupcommand"
                    },
                    {
                      "key": "accessories[].keepadbalivewhensleeping"
                    },
                    {
                      "key": "accessories[].keepalivecommand"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "flex",
                  "displayFlex": true,
                  "flex-direction": "row",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "key": "accessories[].startupsettledelay",
                      "flex": "1 1 100px"
                    },
                    {
                      "key": "accessories[].keepaliveinterval",
                      "flex": "1 1 100px"
                    },
                    {
                      "key": "accessories[].powersettledelay",
                      "flex": "1 1 100px"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "flex",
                  "displayFlex": true,
                  "flex-direction": "row",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "key": "accessories[].connectiondebouncecount",
                      "flex": "1 1 100px"
                    },
                    {
                      "key": "accessories[].suppresssleepingdisconnectlogs",
                      "flex": "1 1 100px"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "title": "Playback Sensor",
              "expandable": true,
              "expanded": false,
              "description": "Create motion sensor based on media playback activities (limited device support).",
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "flex",
                  "displayFlex": true,
                  "flex-direction": "row",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "key": "accessories[].playbacksensor",
                      "flex": "1 1 100px"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "flex",
                  "displayFlex": true,
                  "flex-direction": "row",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "key": "accessories[].playbacksensorexclude",
                      "flex": "2 2 200px"
                    },
                    {
                      "key": "accessories[].playbacksensordelay",
                      "flex": "1 1 100px"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "title": "Control Center Remote and Power ON/OFF",
              "expandable": true,
              "expanded": false,
              "description": "Assign custom <a href='https://developer.android.com/reference/android/view/KeyEvent' target='blank'>ADB keycodes</a> for Control Center Remote.",
              "items": [
                {
                  "description": "<ul><li>You can put one or more <a href='https://developer.android.com/reference/android/view/KeyEvent' target='blank'>ADB keycodes</a> by seperating them with space, eg: \"<code>KEYCODE_VOLUME_UP KEYCODE_VOLUME_DOWN</code>\".</li><li>Or, you can put ADB shell command, eg: \"<code>monkey -p com.termux 1</code>\".</li><li>Or, you can also put a shell script, add \"<code>shell</code>\" identifier on the beginning to let the plugins know it's a shell script, eg: \"<code>shell sh ./myscript.sh</code>\".</li><li>Or, you can also run an app by putting the app id, eg: \"<code>com.google.android.youtube.tv</code>\".</li><li>Or, leave them empty to use default values.</li></ul>",
                  "items": []
                },
                {
                  "title": "Volume",
                  "description": "Custom <a href='https://developer.android.com/reference/android/view/KeyEvent' target='blank'>ADB keycodes</a> or app id or shell scripts for control center remote volume control.",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "type": "flex",
                      "displayFlex": true,
                      "flex-direction": "row",
                      "items": [
                        {
                          "key": "accessories[].volumeup",
                          "flex": "1 1 100px"
                        },
                        {
                          "key": "accessories[].volumedown",
                          "flex": "1 1 100px"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "title": "D-Pad",
                  "description": "Custom <a href='https://developer.android.com/reference/android/view/KeyEvent' target='blank'>ADB keycodes</a> or app id or shell script for control remote center control.",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "type": "flex",
                      "displayFlex": true,
                      "flex-direction": "row",
                      "items": [
                        {
                          "flex": "1 1 100px"
                        },
                        {
